    "media:imagetext": "DESERET BOOK COMPANY, SALT LAKE CITY, UTAH\nSalt Lake City, is one of the most important\nairports in the United States, being the second\nlargest air-mail center in the country. It is the hub\nof four large operating companies carrying mail.\npassengers, and express throughout the Intermountain\ncountry and the East.\nThe large modern hangers are equipped with full\nfacilities for 24 hour service per day.\nBeing located adjacent to so many National Parks,\nmany air travelers, commercial and tourist, pass\nthrough this port which is located 4 miles due west\nfrom Salt Lake City.\nThe Plane on the left in the picture is a Western\nAir Express Tri Motor, Fokker, eight passenger,\n135 mile Transport. The other a United Air Line\nBymotor, ten passenger, 185 mile Transport.\nPOST CARD\nTHIS SPACE FOR ADDRESS ONLY\nPLACE\nONE CENT\nSTAMP\nHERE\nAMERICAN ART COLORED\n2015.166.2259",
